ke it photorealistic\n- keep the design clean so it works well in a pixel art top-down game\n- the final asset should be a single standalone wall decoration sprite\n- transparent background preferred\nThe final result should feel like a cozy kitchen wall decoration in a restaurant, showing hanging cookware and utensils in a visually appealing way, suitable for a pixel art top-down cooking game.\nKeywords: pixel art, top-down kitchen decoration, wall-mounted cookware rack, hanging kitchen tools, restaurant kitchen asset, cooking game decoration, cozy restaurant pixel art, utensil wall display, 2D game asset, transparent background.",
